{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>For</b> — At first he said: 'And I am like a moth to Ephraim, and like decay to the house of Judah' (Hosea 5:12), meaning from within the body. And now, when he strikes from outside — 'and who will heal you.'"], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {0 "The comment references Hosea 5:12; Ibn Ezra's terse wording leaves the contrast between 'from within' and 'from outside' implicit."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:19.324701191Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}